        "created_at": "2015-02-10T08:57:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ronway is 180 Ronway? Does this not then lead to an infinite loop of Ronway?</p><p>Infinite Ronways! I can hear the theme tune to the Saturday morning cartoon now...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Super Mega Ronway Force</em>,</p><p><em>Fighting Dragon Power</em>,</p><p><em>Super Mecha Ronway Force</em>,</p><p><em>This is their finest hour!</em></p><p><em>Calling all Ronway,</em></p><p><em>Time to save the day,</em></p><p><em>Rescue the galaxy</em>,</p><p><em>While incapping heroes</em>,</p><p><em>Dammit Ronway </em><em>Mega Force</em>!</p><p><em>**Air Guitar solo**</em></p>",
