        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-10T13:03:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Why are we still wondering who the Progenitor, cosmic über-villain may be ?</p><p>It seems obvious that it is the infamous pantless RONWAY !</p><p>And it is obvious it is in fact the ultimate incarnation of another villain : <strong>Omnitronway</strong> !</p><p>He flies through the universe, destroying pants everywhere !</p><p>Deadline's plan is to destroy all pants on earth to keep him away !</p><p>... I should have been a writer for marvel in the 60s ...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit : feverishly counting heroes who don't wear pants, as the child in the center may be one of them !</p>",
