        "created_at": "2015-02-12T09:53:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So it looks like none of us <em><font color=\"pink\">[size=18]<strong>love</strong></font><strong>[/size]</strong></em> Ronway…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.rockpapercynic.com/index.php?date=2015-02-11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Rock Paper Cynic: a webcomic for the unimpressed</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.rockpapercynic.com/strips/2015-02-11-true-love-means-never-having-to-say-put-pants-on-v.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.rockpapercynic.com/index.php?date=2015-02-11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Love means never having to say these 3 horrible words - a Rock Paper Cynic comic</a></h3>\n\n<p>in this comic, in this Valentine's Day comic, we reflect on the sign of a deep and meaningful relationship</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
